  clueId: ff_stairs
  displayTitle: Scrawled By The Stairwell
  bodyText: The bottom of it came down years ago and nobody is coming to clear it.
    There is a linen crate down the hall on castors - get it up against the fall
    and you can go over the top. It is heavy and it screams the whole way, so do
    it in pairs and stop when you need to. It cannot hear you standing still.
